# Service Definition (Ranz VPN Server)
SVC_VPNSERVER_NAME		vpnserver
SVC_VPNSERVER_TITLE		Ranz VPN Server
SVC_VPNSERVER_DESCRIPT	This manages the server processes of Ranz VPN Server. Ranz VPN Server provides high-performance Ranz VPN Server functions via TCP/IP protocol. When this service is stopped, Ranz VPN Server on this computer will stop and Ranz VPN Client will be unable to establish a VPN connection with this computer.


# Service Definition (Ranz VPN Server)
SVC_SEVPNSERVERDEV_NAME		sevpnserverdev
SVC_SEVPNSERVERDEV_TITLE		Ranz VPN Server
SVC_SEVPNSERVERDEV_DESCRIPT	This manages the server processes of Ranz VPN Server. Ranz VPN Server provides high-performance Ranz VPN Server functions via TCP/IP protocol. When this service is stopped, Ranz VPN Server on this computer will stop and Ranz VPN Client will be unable to establish a VPN connection with this computer.


